  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 57797273182208
    m_Localized: 爱心全碎了
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542336
    m_Localized: 一如既往地好
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542337
    m_Localized: 冰冻的食材无法拿取。拿起旁边的物品来打破冰块。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542338
    m_Localized: 领取
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542339
    m_Localized: 在食材队列中找到钥匙来解锁。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542340
    m_Localized: 风味爆发
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542341
    m_Localized: 食物组合
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542342
    m_Localized: 免费
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542343
    m_Localized: 冰冻物品
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542344
    m_Localized: 知道了！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542345
    m_Localized: 困难的一天！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542346
    m_Localized: 你好，很高兴认识你
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542347
    m_Localized: 隐藏物品
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542348
    m_Localized: 隐藏物品只有到达最上面一行时才会显现。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542349
    m_Localized: 长按查看地图
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542350
    m_Localized: 长按查看
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542351
    m_Localized: 主页
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542352
    m_Localized: 冰块
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542353
    m_Localized: 食材用完了！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542354
    m_Localized: 离开
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542355
    m_Localized: 开始营业吧！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542356
    m_Localized: 连锁物品
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542357
    m_Localized: 锁与钥匙
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542358
    m_Localized: 音乐
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542359
    m_Localized: 新道具
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542360
    m_Localized: 新食材
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542361
    m_Localized: 确定
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542362
    m_Localized: 哎呀？！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542363
    m_Localized: 步数用完了
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542364
    m_Localized: 失去耐心了
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542365
    m_Localized: 槽位已满
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542366
    m_Localized: 已暂停
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542367
    m_Localized: 完美
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542368
    m_Localized: 当所有相连的格子都到达最前面时，一起拿取它们。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542369
    m_Localized: 退出这一天？
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542370
    m_Localized: 重试
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542371
    m_Localized: 服务一定数量的顾客来打破桌上的冰块。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542372
    m_Localized: 出了点问题，再试一次吧！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542373
    m_Localized: 音效
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542374
    m_Localized: 超难的一天！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542375
    m_Localized: 点击继续
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542376
    m_Localized: 点击开始
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542377
    m_Localized: 美味提升中
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542378
    m_Localized: 这些食物会一起移动，并作为一个整体被拿取。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542379
    m_Localized: 夹子
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542380
    m_Localized: 振动
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542381
    m_Localized: 观看
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542382
    m_Localized: 你将失去1颗爱心！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57797302542383
    m_Localized: BOSS 登场！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 791119221743616
    m_Localized: BOSS 登场
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 791119234326528
    m_Localized: 槽位已满！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5836114773401600
    m_Localized: 冰冻格子
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5836114806956032
    m_Localized: 新功能
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5838819617136640
    m_Localized: 新餐厅
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5838819617136641
    m_Localized: 新餐厅即将开业！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7340303286525952
    m_Localized: 干得漂亮！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7340303307497472
    m_Localized: 挑战失败
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7542428218155008
    m_Localized: 大厨威武！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7542428239126528
    m_Localized: 厨神降临！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7542428243320832
    m_Localized: 太难啦！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7542428243320833
    m_Localized: 后厨大乱！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
